	(text "BUS BUFFER, 3.3 V: GROUP 1 ALWAYS ENABLED (CS, SYNC_CLK, SYNC_START).\nTHE BUFFERED CS ENABLES GROUP 2: SCLK AND MOSI IN, MISO OUT THROUGH 62R\n(INT-4). DESELECTED, GROUP 2 RELEASES THE FPGA'S CONFIGURATION SPI PINS, SO\nA GOLDEN-IMAGE BOOT CAN DRIVE THEM; 100R LIMITS A CLASH IF THE BOARD IS\nSELECTED DURING ONE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
